ce-banded offers."}, {"id": "docs_timed_offers_bagsfromoption", "label": "bagsFrom config option (bag list sourced from repo CSV)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/timed-offers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_timed_offers_stockfromoption", "label": "stockFrom config option (in-stock sourced from repo CSV)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/timed-offers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_timed_offers_bucketfunction", "label": "_bucket() function (Python bucketing of bag products)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/timed-offers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_timed_offers_pythonbucketingoptimization", "label": "Python-side bucketing vs ILIKE OR-chain optimization", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/timed-offers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fetches all bag products in scope and buckets in Python instead of OR-ing 60-70+ ILIKE patterns \u2014 about 3x faster on a month of Kenya sales."}, {"id": "docs_timed_offers_streamlitapppy", "label": "streamlit_app.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/timed-offers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_timed_offers_scripttimeoutconfig", "label": "SCRIPT_TIMEOUT = 600s config", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/timed-offers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_timed_offers_libdbrunquerycached", "label": "lib/db.run_query_cached() TTL disk cache", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/timed-offers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_timed_offers_ttldiskcacherationale", "label": "TTL disk-cache rationale (.odoo_cache/)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/timed-offers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Slow Odoo lookups cached to disk keyed by exact SQL+params; POS sales at 30 min TTL, metadata loops at 12h TTL since they were 77 round-trips of near-static data. Manual Refresh sets DENRI_FORCE_FRESH=1 to bypass. Measured cold ~251s -> warm ~62s."}, {"id": "docs_timed_offers_denriforcefreshenvvar", "label": "DENRI_FORCE_FRESH=1 env var", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/timed-offers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_timed_offers_whyrejecttotalstable", "label": "\"Why these bags?\" reject-only + totals table", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/timed-offers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_timed_offers_otherrejectscatchallrow", "label": "\"Other rejects\" catch-all row (_OTHER_REJECTS)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/timed-offers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "_bucket maps a product to a listed bag by longest-prefix; unmatched [REJECT] units (colour/condition or plural/variant spelling mismatches) used to be silently dropped, under-counting the total (165 shown vs true count). Collected under one Other rejects row so headline TOTAL sold equals every reject sold."}, {"id": "docs_timed_offers_netofrefundsrule", "label": "Net-of-refunds rule (pl.qty <> 0 via _QTY_SQL)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/timed-offers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rational